## Tutorials

Thejustify-contentproperty  
aligns the flex items along the main-axis (horizontally).

This property can have one of the following values:

### Code Examples

```
.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: center;
}

---

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: flex-start;
}

---

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: flex-end;
}

---

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-around;
}

---

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-between;
}

---

.flex-container {
display: flex;
justify-content: space-evenly;
}
```

